#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a locker.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特に意味がある物はなさそうだし、
#. 開ける必要はないかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It doesn't seem especially important right now, so I\n"
"don't need to open it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ソファーだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A couch...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>気になることは…特にないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's nothing here I really need to worry about...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ゆったりとしたテーブルだ。
#. 教室にある机とは、雰囲気が違うな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a table here. It's kinda similar to the desks\n"
"in the classroom...but also kinda not.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、事件とは関係なさそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's not really related to the case, though...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、なんだ？
#. よくわからないけど…インテリアなんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What is this? Maybe it's just for decoration or\n"
